### State Management (`src/state.js`)

#### Configuration Object (`config`)

Global configuration shared across generation modules.

```javascript
{
  seed: null,                    // Current seed
  cells: 20000,                  // Target cell count
  template: null,                // Template name
  width: 5000,                   // Map width (km)
  height: 5000,                  // Map height (km)
  tempRange: [-20, 27, -20],     // [north edge, center, south edge] (°C)
  prec: 50,                      // Precipitation modifier
  winds: [225, 45, 90, 90, 45, 225], // Wind directions per vertical tier
  heightExponent: 1,             // Height scaling
  lakeElevationLimit: 5,         // Lake closure threshold
  resolveDepressionsSteps: 100   // Depression resolution steps
}
```

#### State Variables

| Variable | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `grid` | object | Current grid data |
| `pack` | object | Packed graph data |
| `seed` | string | Current generation seed |
| `graphWidth` | number | Graph width in pixels |
| `graphHeight` | number | Graph height in pixels |

#### Setter Functions

```javascript
setGrid(g)        // Set grid data
setPack(p)        // Set pack data
setSeed(s)        // Set seed
setGraphSize(w, h)     // Set graph dimensions
```

---

### Heightmap Generator (`generators/heightmap-generator.js`)

#### `HeightmapGenerator`

Class for generating and manipulating heightmaps.

**Methods:**

| Method | Parameters | Description |
|--------|------------|-------------|
| `generate(graph)` | `graph` - Grid object | Generate heightmap from template or image |
| `fromTemplate(graph, id)` | `graph`, `id` - Template ID | Generate from template steps |
| `fromPrecreated(graph, id)` | `graph`, `id` - Image ID | Generate from PNG heightmap image |
| `addHill(count, height, rangeX, rangeY)` | Count, height range, X range, Y range | Add hills to heightmap |
| `addPit(count, height, rangeX, rangeY)` | Count, height range, X range, Y range | Add pits/depressions |
| `addRange(count, height, rangeX, rangeY, start, end)` | Count, height, ranges, start/end cells | Add mountain ranges |
| `addTrough(count, height, rangeX, rangeY, start, end)` | Count, height, ranges, start/end cells | Add troughs/valleys |
| `addStrait(width, direction)` | Width, direction ("vertical"/"horizontal") | Carve straits through land |
| `modify(range, add, mult, power)` | Range, add value, multiply factor, power | Modify heights mathematically |
| `smooth(fr, add)` | Filter radius, addition | Smooth heightmap |
| `mask(power)` | Power factor | Apply edge mask |
| `invert(count, axes)` | Count, axes ("x", "y", "xy") | Invert heightmap |

**Template Format:**

Templates are defined in `data/heightmap-templates.js` as newline-separated steps:

```
Hill 3 20-40 10-90 10-90
Range 2 30-60 20-80 20-80
Pit 1 10-20 30-70 30-70
```

Each step: `Tool count height-range x-range y-range`

