### Biomes (`generators/biomes.js`)

#### `Biomes`

Biome generator instance.

**Methods:**

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `generate()` | Generate biomes for all cells |
| `getDefault()` | Get default biome definitions |

**Default Biomes:**

| ID | Name | Color | Habitability | Cost |
|----|------|-------|--------------|------|
| 0 | Marine | #466eab | 0 | 10 |
| 1 | Hot desert | #fbe79f | 4 | 200 |
| 2 | Cold desert | #b5b887 | 10 | 150 |
| 3 | Savanna | #d2d082 | 22 | 60 |
| 4 | Grassland | #c8d68f | 30 | 50 |
| 5 | Tropical seasonal forest | #b6d95d | 50 | 70 |
| 6 | Temperate deciduous forest | #29bc56 | 100 | 70 |
| 7 | Tropical rainforest | #7dcb35 | 80 | 80 |
| 8 | Temperate rainforest | #409c43 | 90 | 90 |
| 9 | Taiga | #4b6b32 | 12 | 200 |
| 10 | Tundra | #96784b | 4 | 1000 |
| 11 | Glacier | #d5e7eb | 0 | 5000 |
| 12 | Wetland | #0b9131 | 12 | 150 |

**Biome Assignment Logic:**

Biomes are assigned based on:
1. Temperature (from climate model)
2. Moisture (precipitation + river flux)
3. Elevation
4. River presence

The `biomesMatrix` maps moisture bands (0-4) against temperature bands (0-25) to biome IDs.

