#### `Rivers`

River generator instance.

**Methods:**

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `generate()` | Generate river network |
| `regenerate()` | Regenerate rivers and re-specify |
| `specify()` | Add names and types to rivers |

**River Properties:**

```javascript
{
  i: number,           // River ID
  source: number,      // Source cell ID
  mouth: number,       // Mouth cell ID
  discharge: number,   // Water discharge
  length: number,      // River length
  width: number,       // River width
  widthFactor: number, // Width scaling factor
  sourceWidth: number, // Source width
