### Ice (`generators/ice.js`)

#### `Ice`

Ice feature generator instance.

**Methods:**

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `generate()` | Generate glaciers and icebergs |
| `regenerate()` | Regenerate ice features |
| `addIceberg(cellId, size)` | Add iceberg at cell |
| `removeIce(id)` | Remove ice feature |
| `randomizeIcebergShape(id)` | Randomize iceberg shape |

**Ice Types:**

- **Glaciers** (`iceShield`): Generated on land where temp ≤ -8°C and height ≥ 20
- **Icebergs:** Generated on water where temp ≤ 0°C

**Ice Properties:**

```javascript
{
  i: number,      // Ice feature ID
  points: number[][], // Polygon points
  type: "glacier" | "iceberg",
  cellId: number, // Source cell (icebergs)
  size: number    // Size factor (icebergs)
}
```

---

### Features (`generators/features.js`)

#### `Features`

Feature markup module instance.

**Methods:**

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `markupGrid()` | Mark grid features (oceans, lakes, islands) |
| `markupPack()` | Mark packed graph features |
| `defineGroups()` | Define feature groups (ocean, sea, gulf, continent, island, isle, etc.) |

**Feature Types:**

- **Grid level:** ocean, lake, island
- **Pack level:** ocean, sea, gulf, continent, island, isle, lake, lake_island

**Feature Properties:**

```javascript
{
  i: number,           // Feature ID
  type: string,        // Feature type
  land: boolean,       // Is land feature
  border: boolean,     // Touches map border
  cells: number,       // Cell count
  firstCell: number,   // First cell ID
  vertices: number[],  // Vertex IDs
  area: number,        // Area
  shoreline: number[], // Shoreline cells (lakes)
  height: number       // Surface height (lakes)
}
```

**Feature Groups:**

| Group | Criteria |
|-------|----------|
| Ocean | > 4% of total cells |
| Sea | > 0.1% of total cells |
| Gulf | < 0.1% of total cells |
| Continent | > 10% of total cells |
| Island | > 0.1% of total cells |
| Isle | < 0.1% of total cells |

---

### Voronoi (`generators/voronoi.js`)

#### `Voronoi`

Voronoi diagram generator from Delaunay triangulation.

**Constructor:**

```javascript
new Voronoi(delaunay, points, pointsN)
```

**Properties:**

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `delaunay` | Delaunator | Delaunay triangulation |
| `points` | number[][] | Point coordinates |
| `pointsN` | number | Number of points |
| `cells` | object | Voronoi cells |
| `vertices` | object | Voronoi vertices |

**Cell Structure:**

```javascript
{
  v: number[],  // Adjacent vertex IDs
  c: number[],  // Adjacent cell IDs
  b: number     // Border flag (0/1)
}
```

**Vertex Structure:**

```javascript
{
  p: number[],  // Vertex coordinates [x, y]
  v: number[],  // Adjacent vertex IDs
  c: number[]   // Adjacent cell IDs
}
```

