### Utilities (`utils/`)

#### `arrayUtils.js`

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `last(array)` | Get last element |
| `unique(array)` | Get unique elements |
| `getTypedArray(maxValue)` | Get appropriate typed array constructor |
| `createTypedArray({maxValue, length, from})` | Create typed array |

#### `numberUtils.js`

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `rn(v, d)` | Round to d decimal places |
| `minmax(value, min, max)` | Clamp value between min and max |
| `lim(v)` | Clamp between 0 and 100 |
| `normalize(val, min, max)` | Normalize to 0-1 range |
| `lerp(a, b, t)` | Linear interpolation |

#### `probability.js`

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `rand(min, max)` | Random integer in range |
| `P(probability)` | Boolean with probability |
| `each(n)` | Returns function that's true every n times |
| `gauss(expected, deviation, min, max, round)` | Gaussian random |
| `Pint(float)` | Integer with probability of rounding up |
| `ra(array)` | Random array element |
| `rw(object)` | Random weighted key from object |
| `biased(min, max, ex)` | Biased random toward min |

#### `graphUtils.js`

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `placePoints(graphWidth, graphHeight)` | Place jittered grid points |
| `shouldRegenerateGrid(grid, expectedSeed, w, h)` | Check if grid needs regeneration |
| `calculateVoronoi(points, boundary)` | Calculate Voronoi diagram |
| `getPackPolygon(cellId)` | Get polygon for packed cell |

#### `path.js`

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `getIsolines(graph, getType, options)` | Get isolines for cell types |
| `getFillPath(vertices, vertexChain)` | Generate SVG fill path |
| `getBorderPath(vertices, vertexChain, discontinue)` | Generate SVG border path |
| `restorePath(exit, start, from)` | Restore path from exit to start |

#### `index.js`

Re-exports all utilities:

```javascript
import {
  // From arrayUtils
  last, unique, getTypedArray, createTypedArray, TYPED_ARRAY_MAX,
  // From graphUtils
  placePoints, shouldRegenerateGrid, calculateVoronoi, getPackPolygon,
  // From numberUtils
  rn, minmax, lim, normalize, lerp,
  // From path
  getIsolines, getFillPath, getBorderPath, restorePath,
  // From probability
  rand, P, each, gauss, Pint, ra, rw, biased,
  // Plus
  round, distanceSquared, isLand, isWater, findGridCell,
  getNumberInRange, connectVertices, clipPoly, projectToNearestEdge,
  meander, polylabel, lineclip
} from "./utils/index.js";
```

