### Debug (`utils/debug.js`)

Debug flags (all default to `false`):

```javascript
TIME    // Enable timing logs
DEBUG   // Debug object for module-specific flags
WARN    // Enable warnings
ERROR   // Enable errors
```

Example usage:

```javascript
import { TIME, DEBUG } from "./utils/debug.js";

TIME && console.time("operation");
// ... code ...
TIME && console.timeEnd("operation");

DEBUG.temperature && console.info("Temperature:", temp);
```

