## Dependencies

External libraries (loaded via import maps in `index.html`):

| Library | Version | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| d3 | 7.9.0 | Data visualization, geometry, statistics |
| alea | 1.0.1 | Seeded random number generator |
| simplex-noise | 4.0.3 | 2D/3D noise generation |
| delaunator | 5.0.1 | Delaunay triangulation |
| polylabel | 1.1.0 | Polygon label point finding |
| lineclip | 1.1.5 | Line clipping |

---

## Spherical Conventions

For globe rendering and coordinate systems:

- Coordinates are `[lon, lat]` in degrees on a unit sphere
- $lon \in [-180, 180]$, $lat \in [-90, 90]$
- Spherical distances must use 3D unit vectors or haversine formulas
- For longitude deltas across the antimeridian, use modular $\pm 180^\circ$ wrapping
- Canvas/SVG globe rendering should use D3's `geoPath(projection, ctx)` with GeoJSON

